            <ArticleTitle>Infected renal cyst simulating acute abdomen. Case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>135</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Renal cysts are rarely infected. The diagnosis should not represent a problem with the current techniques: however the condition can simulate acute abdomen in which case resection of the cyst roof and drainage is recommended.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
